<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id" />
  <para style="h">1 JO TECALONIKA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Waraga mukwongo ma Paulo ocoyo bot Jo Tecalonika</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Jo Tecalonika</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Tec</para>
  <para style="mt2">Waraga mukwongo ma Paulo ocoyo bot</para>
  <para style="mt1">JO TECALONIKA</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">Tecalonika onongo obedo taun madit me kom ker madit pa jo Roma ki i Macedonia. Paulo ocako kanica man ikare ma oa ki i Pilippi. Ento Lujudaya gucako jemo ikom Paulo kun gudoko nyek woko ikome ikare ma en ocako pwony ikom lok mamako kwo pa Lukricitayo bot lurok ma onongo gimito niang dini pa Lujudaya. Piman Paulo oa woko ki kunu ci ocito i Berea. Lacen ma oo i Korint, Temceo ma obedo lawange dok latic lawote ocwalo kwena bote mamako lok ma obedo ka time i kanica ma i Tecalonika.</para>
  <para style="ip">Waraga pa Paulo me acel bot jo Tecalonika kicoyo me cuko cwiny Lukricitayo ma kunu. Kun en miyo pwoc botgi pi niyegi ki pi margi ma en owinyo pire; kun poyo wigi ikit kwo ma en obedo kwede ikin gi ikare ma en ceng tye kwedgi; ka dok lacen en bene ogamo lapeny mamako lok me dwogo cen pa Yecu i ngom kany. Dano onongo gipenye ni: Lakricitayo mono kace dong oto woko ma Yecu peya odwogo ci en tika binywako kacel i kwo ma labednaka iceng ma Yecu bidwogo? Dok bene ni Kricito mono bidwogo awene? Paulo otito botgi nia gin omyero gumede ki ticgi lalingling kun gumede ki kuru Kricito ki gen labongo akalakala.</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Lanyut <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TH 1:1">1:1</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Pwoc ki pak <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TH 1:2-3:13">1:2—3:13</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Cuko cwiny i kwo pa Lukricitayo <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TH 4:1-12">4:1-12</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Pwony mamako dwogo pa Kricito <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TH 4:13-5:11">4:13—5:11</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Lok me agiki <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TH 5:12-22">5:12-22</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ladol telok <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TH 5:23-28">5:23-28</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1" />
  <para style="s1">Mot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 17:1">Tic 17:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Waraga man oa ki bot an Paulo ki Silvano ka Temceo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 1:1">Bot jo ma oye Kricito ma gibedo i Tecalonika ma gitye i Lubanga Won ki Rwotwa Yecu Kricito:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 1:1">Kica ki kuc obed botwu.<verse eid="1TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwo ki niye pa jo Tecalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2" />Wamiyo pwoc bot Lubanga jwijwi pirwu ducu kun walwongo nyingwu ilegawa me kare ducu. <verse eid="1TH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3" />Pien wiwa po inyim Lubanga Wonwa ikit ma wuketo kwede niyewu i tic, ki kit ma wucane kwede pi mar, dok ki kit ma wudiyo kwede cwinywu pi gen ma wutye kwede i Rwotwa Yecu Kricito. <verse eid="1TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4" />Utmegiwa ma Lubanga maro, wangeyo ni Lubanga dong otyeko yerowu; <verse eid="1TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5" />pien lok me Kwena Maber ma watito botwu yam pe obino botwu i lok keken, ento obino ki teko, ki i Cwiny Maleng kun onongo lok meno odonyo matut icwinywu. Wungeyo maber kit ma wan wabedo kwede ikinwu kun wakonyowu. <verse eid="1TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:5-9">Tic 17:5-9</ref></char></note> Wun bene yam wucako poro kitwa ki kit pa Rwot, pien wuye loke ikare ma onongo giunuwu matek ma wubedo ki yomcwiny ma Cwiny Maleng miyo. <verse eid="1TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7" />Man omiyo wudoko lanen bot jo ducu muye Yecu ma gitye i Macedonia ki Akaya. <verse eid="1TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8" />Pien wumiyo lok pa Rwot owinye, pe i Macedonia ki Akaya keken, ento lok pi niyewu ikom Lubanga dong oywek oromo kabedo ducu, ma wan ki komwa dok pe waromo loko iye gin mo. <verse eid="1TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9" />Pien gin ki komgi aye gitito lok mukemowa, kit macalo yam wujolowa kwede, kadi wa kit ma wuloke kwede bot Lubanga, kun wubwoto woro jogi pi woro Lubanga makwo, dok me ada, <verse eid="1TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10" />dok wutye ka kuru Wode ma bidwogo ki i polo, mayam en ocero woko ki ikin jo ma oto, en aye Yecu ma olarowa ki i akemo pa Lubanga ma bibino.<verse eid="1TH 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Tic pa Paulo i Tecalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1" />Utmegiwa, wun ki komwu wungeyo ni, binowa botwu yam pe obedo me nono. <verse eid="1TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:19-24">Tic 16:19-24</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:1-9">Tic 17:1-9</ref></char></note> Kadi bed waneno can, dok bene kitimo tim me lewic ikomwa i Pilipi macalo wun wungeyo, kadi pyem obedo dwong, Lubangawa omiyo botwa tekcwiny me tito botwu lok me Kwena Maber kamaleng. <verse eid="1TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3" />Pien lok ma wakelo pe oa ki itam ma ogom nyo tam ma pe leng, goba bene pe iye. <verse eid="1TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4" />Ento kit macalo Lubanga dong opwoyowa, ci cut omiyowa lok me Kwena Maber me atita, wan bene dong watito kitmeno, pe pi yomo cwiny dano, ento pi yomo cwiny Lubanga ma ngiyo cwinywa. <verse eid="1TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5" />Wungeyo ni, wan yam pe wabino botwu ki lok me bita, dok bene pe wakano tamwa pi nongo lim, Lubanga aye cadenwa. <verse eid="1TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6" />Pe bene wayenyo deyo ki bot dano mo, kadi ki botwu nyo ki bot jo mukene, <verse eid="1TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7" />kadi bed onongo watye ki twero me nongo jami ki botwu, pien wan wabedo lukwena pa Kricito. Ento yam wabedo ma wamwol ikinwu macalo mego ma gwoko lutinone. <verse eid="1TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8" />Waparo pirwu mada, omiyo nene pe wamito miyo botwu lok me Kwena Maber keken ma oa ki bot Lubanga, ento kadi wan ki komwa dong watyeko mine woko botwu, pien wamarowu dok pirwu tek botwa tutwal.<verse eid="1TH 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9" />Utmegiwa, wutwero po kit ma ceng wacane kwede i tic, ikare ma watitiwu lok me Kwena Maber ma oa ki bot Lubanga, kun watiyo dyeceng ki dyewor wek pe wanurwu ki lego kony mo ki botwu. <verse eid="1TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10" />Wun wucadenwa, ki Lubanga bene ngeyo kit ma wabedo kwede maleng dok ma kitwa atir, labongo lok mo ma oloyowa inyimwu wun jo ma oye Yecu. <verse eid="1TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11" />Dok wungeyo kit ma waterowu kwede macalo lunyodo tero ki lutinogi. <verse eid="1TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12" />Dok wacuku cwinywu bene ni, wulub kit kwo ma myero bot Lubanga ma olwongowu iker ma mere ki ideyone.<verse eid="1TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13" />Man aye gin ma omiyo wapwoyo Lubanga kare ki kare, pien cake ma wugamo lok pa Lubanga ma wuwinyo ki botwa, pe wugamo macalo lok pa dano, ento macalo lok pa Lubanga. Ada aye lok pa Lubanga tye bene katic i iwu wun jo ma oye Yecu. <verse eid="1TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:5">Tic 17:5</ref></char></note> Utmegiwa, wun bene wumako kit pa lwak jo ma oye Lubanga matye i Kricito Yecu, ikabedo ducu matye i Judaya. Pien wun bene wuneno can ki bot lutuwu kikome marom ki can ma gin guneno bot Lujudaya, <verse eid="1TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:23">Tic 9:23</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 9:29">29</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:45">13:45</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 13:50">50</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 14:2">14:2</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 14:5">5</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 14:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 17:5">17:5</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 17:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 18:12">18:12</ref></char></note> ma ceng guneko Rwot Yecu ki lunebi, ka guryemowa woko bene. Pe guyomo cwiny Lubanga, ento gupyem apyema ki jo ducu! <verse eid="1TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16" />Gin bene gutemo gengowa woko me tito lok bot Lurok wek gulare. Man omiyo gumede ameda ki timo gin marac. Ento akemo pa Lubanga dong obino woko ikomgi matwal.<verse eid="1TH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Miti pa Paulo dok me nenogi wang ki wang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17" />Utmegiwa, ma ceng kipokowa woko kwedwu pi kare manok ikom ento pe i cwiny, watemo tutwal ki miti madwong me nongo yo wek dok wanene kwedwu wang ki wang. <verse eid="1TH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18" />Yam onongo wamito mada me bino botwu. An Paulo atemo tyen mapol, ento Catan ogengowa woko. <verse eid="1TH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19" />Genwa ki yomcwinywa ki lalukana me nyatewa inyim Rwot Yecu Kricito idwogone, en gin ango? Pe wun? <verse eid="1TH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20" />Pien wun aye wubedo deyowa ki yomcwinywa.<verse eid="1TH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 17:15">Tic 17:15</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ikare madong waneno ni pe waromo ciro paro pirwu, omiyo wamoko tamwa me dong woko cen kenwa i Atene, <verse eid="1TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2" />ci waoro botwu Temceo, ma en ominwa ki latic pa Lubanga itito lok me Kwena Maber ikom Kricito, wek ojing cwinywu obed tek dok odi cwinywu ikom niyewu, <verse eid="1TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3" />wek can magi pe oryang kom dano mo. Wun ki komwu wungeyo ni can ma kitmeno myero opot ikomwa. <verse eid="1TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4" />Pien ikare ma pud watye kacel kwedwu watitiwu con ni, ikare mo i anyim wabineno can, madong bene otime woko kit macalo wungeyoni. <verse eid="1TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5" />Pi lok man, ikare madong anongo ni pe aromo diyo cwinya, aoro dano botwu wek aniang ikom niyewu, kace labit dano dong obitowu woko, nyo ticwa ma watiyo bene dongo olal nono. <verse eid="1TH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:5">Tic 18:5</ref></char></note> Ento kombedi ma Temceo dong odwogo botwa ikare ma oa ki botwu ci okelo botwa lok mamit ikom niyewu ki mar ma wutye kwede, dok bene ni wupo pirwa jwijwi ki kica madwong kun wuparo pi nenowa mada macalo wan bene waparo me nenowu. <verse eid="1TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7" />Piman utmegiwa, meno aye gin ma omiyo cwinywa okwe ikomwu pi niyewu, i can ki i un ma giunowa kwede ducu. <verse eid="1TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8" />Piman kombedi dong wabedo kwo ka wacung matek i Rwot. <verse eid="1TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9" />Kit pwoc ango mupore ma waromo miyo bot Lubanga pirwu, ki pi yomcwiny ducu ma wumiyowa mamiyo cwinywa bedo yom inyim Lubanga? <verse eid="1TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10" />I dyeceng ki dyewor walego Lubanga matek tutwal pi nenowu wang ki wang, wek wamed botwu gin murem ikom niyewu.<verse eid="1TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11" />Walego ni Lubanga Wonwa kikome, ki Rwotwa Yecu Kricito, myero omii wanong yo me bino botwu. <verse eid="1TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12" />Dok walego Rwot okonywu wek wumede matek tutwal i mar, kun ngat acel acel maro lawote ki jo ducu, ikit ma wan wamarowu kwede. <verse eid="1TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13" />Kitmeno bene en bijingo cwinywu wek obed tek wek wubed jo maleng labongo lok mo maloyowa inyim Lubanga Wonwa, ikare me dwogo pa Rwotwa Yecu ki jone maleng ducu.<verse eid="1TH 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4" />
  <para style="s1">Kwo ma Lubanga mito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1" />Me agikine utmegiwa, walegowu kun wabako dogwa botwu i Rwot Yecu ni, wumede anyim nakanaka me bedo ki kit kwo ma wumako ki botwa, ma yomo cwiny Lubanga, ma wutye kalubuneni. <verse eid="1TH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2" />Pien wungeyo cik mayam wamiyo botwu ki twero pa Rwot Yecu. <verse eid="1TH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3" />Gin ma Lubanga mito en ene, ni myero wudok jo maleng dok wuwek tim me kwele obedi. <verse eid="1TH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4" />Dano acel acel myero onge bedo ki dakone kene<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">4:4 </char> <char style="ft" closed="false">bedo ki dakone kene nyo loyo kome kene. </char></note> i cwiny maleng dok me woro. <verse eid="1TH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5" />Pe wuwek miti me kom obwowu, macalo lurok ma pe gingeyo Lubanga. <verse eid="1TH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6" />Ngat mo pe otim bal ikom utmegine, dok pe obwole i lok man; pien Rwot kelo pwod i ikom jo ducu ma timo tim magi ducu ma wan yam watito botwu kun wacikowu bene matek. <verse eid="1TH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7" />Lubanga pe olwongowa ka nyobe ki bal, ento kabedo jo maleng. <verse eid="1TH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8" />Kitmeno ngat mukwero winyo pwony man, nongo pe okwero dano, ento nongo okwero Lubanga gire ma omiyowu Cwiny Maleng.<verse eid="1TH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9" />Lok mudok ikom mar me omego, pe myero kico botwu lok mo iye, pien wun ki komwu yam Lubanga dong opwonyowu woko ni wumare kekenwu. <verse eid="1TH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10" />I ada wun wunyutu marowu ikom utmego ducu matye i Macedonia. Piman wabako dogwa botwu ni wumede katimo kitmeno nakanaka. <verse eid="1TH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11" />Wuket bene cwinywu kabedo mot, dok dano acel acel bene opar pi tice kun tiyo ki cinge kit macalo wacikowu kwede, <verse eid="1TH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12" />wek jo matye woko gupwo kitwu, wek pe wubed kalego kony ki bot ngat mo.<verse eid="1TH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dwogo pa Rwot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13" />Utmegiwa, pe wamito wubed ma wukwiya lok ikom jo madong guto woko; meno weko wubibedo ki cwercwiny macalo jo mukene ma gipe ki gen. <verse eid="1TH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14" />Wan waye ni Yecu oto ci ocer woko. Jo ma oto ma kun yam giye Yecu bene gitye kitmeno; Lubanga bikelogi kacel ki Yecu. <verse eid="1TH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15" />Watito botwu lok pa Rwot ma en owaco ni, wan jo makwo ma wadong nio wa inino me dwogo pa Rwot, pe wabitelo nyim jo madong guto. <verse eid="1TH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16" />Rwot kikome bilor piny kun a ki i polo ki lwongo me twer, ma dwon lamalaika madite biwinye, tum pa Lubanga bikok. Jo mayam guto i Kricito aye ma gibikwongo cer, <verse eid="1TH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17" />ka lacen wan jo makwo, ma wadong kibigwarowa kacel kwedgi i pol, wek warwate ki Rwot i dye yamo; ci dong wabibedo kacel ki Rwot nakanaka. <verse eid="1TH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18" />Pimeno, wukwe cwinywu kekenwu ki lok magi.<verse eid="1TH 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5" />
  <para style="s1">Dwogo pa Rwot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1" />Ento lok ma dok ikom kare, ki nino, utmegiwa, pe myero aco pire botwu, <verse eid="1TH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2" />pien wun ki komwu dong wungeyo maber ni, nino pa Rwot bibino macalo lakwo ma bino i dyewor. <verse eid="1TH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3" />Ka dano giwaconi, “Kuc tye, piny okwe mot, gin mo marac pe,” to biturugi atura calo arem me nywal ma turu dako muyac, kalare biloyogi woko. <verse eid="1TH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4" />Ento wun pe wutye ipiny macol, utmegiwa, matwero miyo ninonu turuwu atura calo lakwo. <verse eid="1TH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5" />Pien wun ducu wubedo jo me dero, jo me dyeceng; wan pe jo me dyewor nyo me piny macol. <verse eid="1TH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6" />Pimeno, pe omyero waninu anina macalo jo mukene, ento wabed kaneno piny kun wagwoke. <verse eid="1TH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7" />Pien jo ma nino, ginino dyewor, jo ma mer ki kongo gimer bene dyewor, <verse eid="1TH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8" />ento wan jo me dyeceng myero wabed jo ma wagwoke. Waruku niye ki mar gubed nyonyo me gengo korwa, waruku bene gen me lare obed tok wiwa me lweny. <verse eid="1TH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9" />Pien Lubanga pe oyerowa ni kinigane opot ikomwa, ento ni walare i Rwotwa Yecu Kricito, <verse eid="1TH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10" />mayam oto pirwa, ni wek kadi ka waneno nyo wanino, wabibedo kwo kacel kwede. <verse eid="1TH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11" />Pimeno wucuk cwinywu kekenwu, dok wukonye bene kekenwu wek wudong icwinywu, ngat acel acel okony lawote me dongo, kit macalo wutye katimoneni.<verse eid="1TH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cuko cwiny ki mot me agiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12" />Wabako dogwa botwu utmegiwa, wuwor jo matye katic ikinwu ma gicane pirwu i Rwot, kun gipwonyowu. <verse eid="1TH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13" />Wuket deyo madwong ikomgi pi ticgi, dok wumargi bene. Wubed ki kuc ikinwu kekenwu. <verse eid="1TH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14" />Dok wabako dogwa botwu, utmegiwa, wujuk jo ma balo kare labongo tic, wucuk cwiny jo ma cwinygi odoko nyap, wukony jo ma goro, wudii cwinywu bene ikom dano ducu. <verse eid="1TH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15" />Wunen maber ni ngat mo ikinwu pe ocul gin marac pi tim marac ma kitimo ikome, ento kare ducu wutem me timo ber ikinwu kekenwu ki bot jo ducu. <verse eid="1TH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16" />Cwinywu obed yom kare ducu. <verse eid="1TH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17" />Wuleg Lubanga ma pe wukeng. <verse eid="1TH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18" />Wumii pwoc ikit gin ducu, pien meno aye gin ma Lubanga mito ki botwu i Kricito Yecu. <verse eid="1TH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19" />Pe wugeng Cwiny Maleng me tiyo tice i iwu, <verse eid="1TH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20" />pe wuca bene lok me nebi ma Lubanga miyo bot dano me atita, <verse eid="1TH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21" />ento wubed ki wang mabit me neno jami ducu; wumak gin maber matek. <verse eid="1TH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22" />Wukwer tim maracu ducu.<verse eid="1TH 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23" />Walegoni Lubanga kikome ma en won kuc omiwu wudok jo maleng i yo ducu, ogwok cwinywu ki tipuwu ki komwu wek wubed labongo lok mo maloyowu ikare me dwogo pa Rwota Yecu Kricito. <verse eid="1TH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24" />Ngat ma olwongowuni gene, dok bitiyo.<verse eid="1TH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25" />Utmegiwa, wuleg Lubanga pirwa.<verse eid="1TH 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26" />Wumot utmego ducu ki mot me mar. <verse eid="1TH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27" />Acikowu matek inying Rwot ni, myero wukwan waraga man bot utmego ducu.<verse eid="1TH 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28" />Kica pa Rwotwa Yecu Kricito obed kwedwu.<verse eid="1TH 5:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5" />
</usx>